            Andrés<br/>Almeida
          </h1>
          
          <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/70 mb-12 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-light" data-es="Full Stack Developer & Data Analyst.<br/>Transformo datos en decisiones, código en impacto." data-en="Full Stack Developer & Data Analyst.<br/>Transforming data into decisions, code into impact.">
            Full Stack Developer & Data Analyst.<br/>
            Transformo datos en decisiones, código en impacto.
          </p>
          
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="#projects" class="px-8 py-4 bg-waystar-lime text-waystar-navy font-semibold hover:bg-white transition-all" data-es="Ver proyectos" data-en="View projects">
              Ver proyectos
            </a>
            <a href="#contact" class="px-8 py-4 border border-white/30 text-white font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-all" data-es="Contactar" data-en="Get in touch">
              Contactar
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Decorative element -->
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-waystar-sand to-transparent"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats Section -->
